{
  "name": "e_multichain_drain",
  "title": "(e) Multi-chain drain after key theft",
  "description": "No EIP-7702. A test micro-transfer, a large ETH transfer, then MockToken transfers to the SAME address on chains 1, 10, 42161, 137, 43114. R7 delays at 3 chains and blocks + freezes at 5; R8 counts 10 assets. After the freeze every transfer to that address is blocked, while a normal customer withdrawal from the same hot wallet still goes through. The multi-chain signal comes from history; each sandbox runs only its own chain. The two DELAYed transfers are re-checked by the DELAY worker after 15 minutes: the destination is frozen by then, so they are NOT released.",
